    "title": "OBITUARY: Joyce King Davis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Carpenter ,\n1 days ago Joyce King Davis, age 70 of Murfreesboro, TN, passed away Saturday, October 4, 2025. A native of Rutherford County, she was the daughter of the late Clem J. King and Charlene Parsley King. Joyce was also preceded in death by her brothers, William Earl and Johnnie King, and a sister, Donna Marie King Baum. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
